{"id":"n87811-1-10","stage":5,"title":"회갑 · 花甲","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87811-1-10-1","ko":"요즘에는 구십까지도 다들 너끈히 살더구나.","zh":"现在大家哪怕活到九十岁也完全没问题啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘에는","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구십까지도","meaning":"九十","explanation":"구십：九十；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"구십","audio":"/audio/137035378c565332502b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28637","senseId":"1","lemma":"구십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너끈히","meaning":"绰绰有余地，轻松地","explanation":"너끈히：绰绰有余地，轻松地","readings":[{"term":"너끈히","audio":"/audio/8342dac81925defc35da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40251","senseId":"1","lemma":"너끈히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살더구나.","meaning":"活，活着，生存","explanation":"살다：活，活着，生存；더구나：回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"1","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"137035378c565332","term":"구십","zh":"九十","audio":"/audio/137035378c565332502b.mp3","entryId":"28637","definition":"十的九倍的数目。","pronunciation":["구십"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"8342dac81925defc","term":"너끈히","zh":"绰绰有余地，轻松地","audio":"/audio/8342dac81925defc35da.mp3","entryId":"40251","definition":"在做某事方面不欠缺、很充裕地。","pronunciation":["너끈히"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"活，活着，生存","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"存有生命。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a56367b18dc3db578dcf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87811-1-10-2","ko":"맞아요, 어머니도 이제 회갑이시니 앞으로 삼십 년은 더 사셔야 해요.","zh":"对呀，妈妈现在也到了六十岁，以后还得再活三十年呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아요,","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니도","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회갑이시니","meaning":"花甲，花甲之年，六十岁","explanation":"회갑：花甲，花甲之年，六十岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"회갑","audio":"/audio/6e26dfacf0ae8412b37a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87811","senseId":"1","lemma":"회갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼십","meaning":"三十","explanation":"삼십：三十","readings":[{"term":"삼십","audio":"/audio/ad3bcec25d1da981651f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61994","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년은","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사셔야","meaning":"活，活着，生存","explanation":"살다：活，活着，生存；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"1","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"6e26dfacf0ae8412","term":"회갑","zh":"花甲，花甲之年，六十岁","audio":"/audio/6e26dfacf0ae8412b37a.mp3","entryId":"87811","definition":"人出生后第60年过的第60个生日。","pronunciation":["회갑","훼갑"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"ad3bcec25d1da981","term":"삼십","zh":"三十","audio":"/audio/ad3bcec25d1da981651f.mp3","entryId":"61994","definition":"十的三倍的数目。","pronunciation":["삼십"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"活，活着，生存","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"存有生命。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a934cae1acbe585044b0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.473,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87811","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对呀，妈妈现在也到了六十岁，以后还得再活三十年呢。","从明天开始要举办世界美食文化节呢。","现在大家哪怕活到九十岁也完全没问题啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对呀，妈妈现在也到了六十岁，以后还得再活三十年呢。","现在大家哪怕活到九十岁也完全没问题啊。","从明天开始要举办世界美食文化节呢。"],"answer":0}]}
